	"status": "nonruntime-proposed-candidate",
	"statusNote": "Proposed v03 candidate for the NYC-Chicago air route endpoints only. The runtime does not read this file and v02 stays active. Every figure is still a preliminary 2026 real-world estimate. The M2 door-to-door route-figures gate stays OPEN.",
	"recordedOn": "2026-10-15",
	"basedOn": "game/data/world-travel/rpg-2-star-ocean-the-second_global-earth-travel_locations-routes_m2-us-science-v02_20261015-175011-c454007b.json",
	"respondsTo": "docs/qa/rpg-2-star-ocean-the-second_m2-us-science-route-figures_real-world-travel-audit_qa-note_m2-v02_20261015-195053-10d2525c.md (section 4.1 airport points; section 7 items 2 and 4)",
	"qaNote": "docs/qa/rpg-2-star-ocean-the-second_m2-nyc-chicago-airport-curb-endpoints_v03-candidate_qa-note_m2-v03_20261015-200518-7c3e19a4.md",
	"scope": "Changes only LGA/ORD access and egress endpoints and the block-time window. Car segments, the 120-minute arrival allowance, the zero arrival-side allowance and every location record are unchanged from v02.",
	"assumptions": [
		"Primary carrier pair is United: LGA Terminal B <-> ORD Terminal 1. United is the largest reporting carrier on LGA-ORD over Aug 2025 - Jul 2026 (see carrierRowsLGAtoORD12m). American (LGA B <-> ORD T3) and Delta (LGA C <-> ORD T5) are given as sensitivity rows only.",
		"Access legs end on the upper-level departures roadway; egress legs start on the arrivals roadway. This models a private car or taxi drop-off and pickup at the terminal curb. ORD rideshare pickup is at Terminal 2 departure level (O'Hare directory) and LGA app-ride pickup locations were not examined; neither is modelled.",
		"A curb point is the midpoint of one named OSM roadway way (see curbPoints). The OSM way is the coordinate source; the airport authority pages are the terminal-assignment source. No airport authority publishes curb coordinates that were found.",
		"Car times are free-flow routing-model times (Valhalla auto costing on the FOSSGIS public instance). No traffic factor, time-of-day profile, parking, loading or curb dwell is applied.",
		"Scene points are unchanged from v02: City Hall Park (-74.00708, 40.71205) and the Loop (-87.6297746, 41.881144).",
		"Block time is the pooled median of every scheduled row (cancelled rows included, same definition as v02) over the latest 12 released BTS months, Aug 2025 - Jul 2026. The Aug 2026 file returned HTTP 404 on 2026-10-15.",
		"checkInAndWaitMinutes stays 120 (v02). doorToDoorAllowanceMinutes stays 0 and is NOT a claim that the arrival side takes no time.",
		"Component minutes are rounded to whole minutes before summing, because the runtime sums the integer fields (world_route_registry.gd AIR_MINUTE_FIELDS). candidateTotalFromRawComponents shows the unrounded sum.",
		"No 2537 fiction modifier is applied (all 1.0 by omission)."
	],
